<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>SiGU - Inscripción a Materias</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: 'class',
        }
    </script>
</head>
<body class="bg-[#f4f6f9] dark:bg-[#1e2a3a]">
    {{> _layout_header}}
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8 max-w-4xl">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#2a3a4d] rounded-lg shadow-md overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
            <div class="bg-[#1a3a5c] dark:bg-[#112133] p-6 text-white flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center shadow-sm gap-4 border-b border-[#2471a3]">
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Inscripción a Materias</h1>
                    <p class="text-[#eaf2ff] mt-1 text-sm font-medium">Materias habilitadas para cursar según tu plan de estudios y correlatividades.</p>
                </div>
                <a href="/dashboard" class="px-5 py-2 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 border border-white/20 rounded-md transition-colors font-medium shadow-sm text-sm whitespace-nowrap">
                    ← Volver al panel principal
                </a>
            </div>
            
            <div class="p-4 md:p-8">
                {{#successMessage}}
                <div class="bg-green-100 border-l-4 border-green-500 p-4 mb-6 rounded-r-md shadow-sm">
                    <div class="flex items-center">
                        <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-600 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
                        </svg>
                        <p class="text-green-800 font-medium">{{successMessage}}</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                {{/successMessage}}
                
                {{#errorMessage}}
                <div class="bg-red-100 border-l-4 border-red-500 p-4 mb-6 rounded-r-md shadow-sm">
                    <div class="flex items-center">
                        <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-red-600 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
                        </svg>
                        <p class="text-red-800 font-medium">{{errorMessage}}</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                {{/errorMessage}}

                {{#materias}}
                <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 shadow-sm">
                    <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white dark:bg-[#2a3a4d]">
                        <thead>
                            <tr class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#1a2b3c] border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
                                <th class="px-6 py-4 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Código</th>
                                <th class="px-6 py-4 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Materia</th>
                                <th class="px-6 py-4 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider text-center">Año</th>
                                <th class="px-6 py-4 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider text-right">Acción</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100 dark:divide-gray-700">
                            {{#materias}}
                            <tr class="hover:bg-blue-50 dark:hover:bg-[#1f3044] transition-colors group">
                                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-mono">{{codigo}}</td>
                                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">{{nombre}}</td>
                                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm text-center">
                                    <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-300">
                                        {{anio_cursada}}º Año
                                    </span>
                                </td>
                                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-right">
                                    <form action="/estudiante/inscripcion/cursada" method="post" class="inline-block m-0">
                                        <input type="hidden" name="materia_codigo" value="{{codigo}}">
                                        <button type="submit" 
                                                class="px-5 py-2 bg-[#2471a3] hover:bg-[#1a5276] text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-md shadow-sm transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#2471a3] focus:ring-offset-2 dark:focus:ring-offset-[#2a3a4d]">
                                            Inscribirse
                                        </button>
                                    </form>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            {{/materias}}
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
                {{/materias}}
                
                {{^materias}}
                <div class="text-center py-16 px-4 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#1a2b3c] rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-600 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#2a3a4d] p-4 rounded-full inline-block shadow-sm mb-4 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700">
                        <svg class="h-10 w-10 text-gray-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-white mb-2">No hay materias disponibles</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-md mx-auto">Actualmente no tienes materias habilitadas para inscribirte en tu plan de estudios o no cumples con las correlatividades requeridas.</p>
                </div>
                {{/materias}}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    {{> _layout_footer}}
</body>
</html>
